# ocel-bench-pack ontology — anchor file (no original vocabulary).
#
# Doctrine (matches packs/togaf-adm-pack/ontology.ttl's extra_ontologies
# convention, commit c0e7cd71): this pack owns no RDFS/OWL classes or
# properties of its own. It is a pure OCEL 2.0 projection + metric-query
# layer over two source vocabularies:
#
#   ocel:  OCEL 2.0 — Object-Centric Event Log Ontology (public standard,
#          IEEE Task Force on Process Mining). Source:
#          crates/praxis-graphlaw/ontologies/core/ocel2.ttl
#   obs:   rwai-bench observation vocabulary (this repo's own logical,
#          non-wall-clock instrumentation terms). Source:
#          crates/praxis-graphlaw/ontologies/core/bench-obs.ttl
#
# Both are unioned into this pack's graph at sync time via this pack's
# ggen.toml `extra_ontologies` entry (crates/ggen/src/config.rs
# PackRef::Path.extra_ontologies), not committed here. Prior to c0e7cd71
# this file was a GENERATED committed union produced by
# packs/ocel-bench-pack/make-ontology.sh, because ggen sync's
# insert_turtle loaded exactly one ontology.ttl per pack and did not
# follow owl:imports. That script's only job was the union (plain
# concatenation of the two source files behind a header comment); it is
# now redundant and has been deleted rather than kept around unused.
#
# The triples below anchor this pack's actual dependency surface: the
# top-level OCEL classes its templates/*.tmpl CONSTRUCT queries project
# into, plus the bench-obs class its metric queries read from. Full
# class/property definitions (rdfs:label, rdfs:comment, rdfs:domain,
# rdfs:range, etc.) live only in the two source files above — duplicating
# them here would reintroduce the drift risk extra_ontologies exists to
# remove.

@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ocel: <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
@prefix obs:  <https://ggen.io/ontology/bench-obs#> .

ocel:EventLog        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
ocel:Event           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
ocel:Object          rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
ocel:EventType       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
ocel:ObjectType      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
ocel:Attribute       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
ocel:Relationship    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
ocel:O2ORelationship rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.ocel-standard.org/2.0/> .
obs:Observation       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ggen.io/ontology/bench-obs#> .
